fields.value:
 * The ability effects are applied as follows:
*# {{Symbol|Modifier|Debuff}} {{Code|clinkz_infernal_shred_armor_piercing}} {{to}} {{Symbol|Affect|Enemy}}
*#* Applies a debuff instance on the attacked enemy unit that affects the enemy unit's [[Armor#Armor Damage Factor|armor damage factor]] value.
*#** Directly interacts with all {{M|armor}}-related [[damage manipulation]] calculations.
*#** {{cf|expr}} {{Code|PhysicalResistance {{=}} ( 1 - ( {{G|armor factor}} × ΣArmor × (1 - InfernalShred Value) ) / ( {{G|armor base}} + {{G|armor factor}} × [[Wikipedia:Absolute value|{{!}}]]ΣArmor[[Wikipedia:Absolute value|{{!}}]]) × (1 - InfernalShred Value) )}}
*#* Neither affects any other [[damage type]]s and {{M|spell damage}} sources, nor incoming attack damage from other targets.
*#* {{Symbol|Modifier|Stack}} 
*#** Reapplying the debuff refreshes the entire stack duration.
*# Clinkz' or the {{U|Skeleton Archer}}'s attack instance ([[after reductions]]).

 {{Gamedesc
| image = {{#var:Infernal Shred icon0}}
| desc = Clinkz and his skeletons apply a stacking debuff that causes their attacks to pierce up to 20% of the target's total physical armor (does not reduce their armor).  Clinkz applies 3% per attack, and skeletons apply 1%.<br><br>Lasts 5 seconds.
}}

