{{Stealnotes
| name = Skeleton Walk
| desc = All {{U|Skeleton Archer|text=Skeleton Archers}}' properties correspond to {{H|Rubick}}'s attributes.<br><br>The [[File:Dota2 Clinkz Skeleton Archer Symbol icon.png|21px|Skeleton Archer|link=Clinkz#Bone and Arrow]] Archers apply {{A|Clinkz|Searing Arrows}} of Clinkz' corresponding ability level when acquired.<br><br>Creates a Skeleton Archer of the corresponding level upon death at Rubick's current location.
}}
{{Draftnotes
| name = Skeleton Walk
| desc = Does not require drafting {{A|Clinkz|Skeleton Walk}} for the {{U|Skeleton Archer}} to work.
}}

 {{Gamedesc
| image = {{#var:Skeleton Walk icon0}}
| desc = Clinkz moves invisibly through units until the moment he attacks or uses items. Leaving Skeleton Walk creates Skeleton Archers.<br><br>Skeleton Archers are immobile and die within multiple attacks from a hero or tower. Skeleton Archers deal a percentage of Clinkz' damage, and deal 75% less damage to buildings. Attack range is equal to Clinkz' attack range.
}}
* [[File:Dota2 Clinkz Skeleton Archer Symbol icon.png|21px|Skeleton Archer]]
** Always created in the same formation per level accordingly to Clinkz's {{M|facing angle}} upon losing {{Symbol|Modifier|Buff}} {{Code|clinkz_wind_walk}}.
** The Archer's attributes correspond to {{A|Clinkz|Bone and Arrow}}'s ability level.
** {{cf|Level|1}} 
*** [[File:Dota2 West.png|31px|West]] [[File:Dota2 PtoL.png|21px]] [[File:Dota2 Letter-p.png|21px|P]] [[File:Dota2 PtoP.png|21px]] {{hi|Clinkz}} {{Symbol|Facing Angle|u}} [[File:Dota2 Letter-o.png|21px|O]] [[File:Dota2 PtoP.png|21px]] [[File:Dota2 Letter-q.png|21px|Q]] [[File:Dota2 PtoR.png|21px]] [[File:Dota2 East.png|31px|East]]
*** Creates {{#explode:{{#var:Skeleton Walk type1 value1}}|/|0}} Archers on Clinkz's east and west corresponding to his {{M|facing angle|t=u}}, at point [[File:Dota2 Letter-p.png|21px|P]] and point [[File:Dota2 Letter-q.png|21px|Q]], forming a straight line.
**** {{Code|OP {{=}} OQ {{=}} 250}}
** {{cf|Level|2}}
*** [[File:Dota2 Clinkz Skeleton Walk Formation 2.png|84px]]
*** Creates {{#explode:{{#var:Skeleton Walk type1 value1}}|/|1}} Archers at point [[File:Dota2 Letter-p.png|21px|P]] , [[File:Dota2 Letter-q.png|21px|Q]] , and [[File:Dota2 Letter-r.png|21px|R]] respectively.
**** {{Code|OP {{=}} OQ {{=}} 250}}, {{Code|OR {{=}} 150}}
**** {{Code|PR {{=}} RQ {{=}} 350}}
**** {{Code|∠ POR {{=}} ∠ POQ {{=}} ∠ ROQ {{=}} 120°}}
** {{cf|Level|3}}
*** [[File:Dota2 Clinkz Skeleton Walk Formation 3.png|84px]]
*** Creates {{#explode:{{#var:Skeleton Walk type1 value1}}|/|2}} Archers at point [[File:Dota2 Letter-p.png|21px|P]] , [[File:Dota2 Letter-q.png|21px|Q]] , [[File:Dota2 Letter-r.png|21px|R]] [[File:Dota2 North.png|31px|North]] , and [[File:Dota2 Letter-s.png|21px|S]] respectively.
**** {{Code|OR {{=}} OQ {{=}} 250}}
**** {{Code|OP {{=}} OS {{=}} 150}}
*** Archer [[File:Dota2 Letter-r.png|21px|R]] will always be in front of Clinkz.

* [[File:Dota2 Clinkz Skeleton Archer Symbol icon.png|21px|Skeleton Archer]]
** Although the unit is controllable, it cannot move.
** Has auto-attack set to default.
** {{A|Skeleton Archer|Searing Arrows}}
*** The Skeleton Archers do not require {{M|mana}} to cast this ability.
*** Sets the ability correspondingly to Clinkz' Searing Arrows ability level per Archer per summon.

